 "links": [7], "label": "字符串", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "size": [519.6051635742188, 448.4638366699219], "pos": [1917.5421142578125, 488.8739013671875], "widgets_values": ["在一片绿意盎然的户外园林中，两位身着华美汉服的年轻女子并肩而立，面带温婉笑容，正对着镜头摆出优雅的姿态。\n\n她们梳着精致繁复的传统发髻，乌黑亮丽的秀发盘绕成古典造型，并点缀以粉色与白色的花朵、羽毛及珠饰头冠，在阳光下熠熠生辉。妆容清丽淡雅，眉目含情，脸颊晕染着自然的红晕，额间点有小巧星月形花钿，尽显古韵之美。\n\n左侧女子身穿粉绿色渐变的薄纱长裙，衣料轻盈飘逸，胸前和袖口处绣有精美的花卉纹样；她双手交叠于胸前，姿态端庄柔美。右侧女子则穿着蓝白相间的同款风格服饰，腰间系有金色丝绦，右手向外摊开，似在邀请或展示，神情活泼灵动。\n\n背景是茂密葱茏的树木枝叶，斑驳的日光透过树叶洒落下来，在两人身上投下柔和光影，营造出宁静梦幻般的氛围。远处隐约可见几位工作人员的身影，暗示这可能是一场精心策划的拍摄活动。整幅画面色彩清新明快，构图和谐唯美，充满了浓郁的东方古典美学韵味。"], "inputs": [{"name": "text", "link": 1, "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 1, "type": "ShowText|pysssss", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui-custom-scripts", "ver": "f2838ed5e59de4d73cde5c98354b87a8d3200190", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "version": "7.0.1"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ShowText|pysssss"}, "order": 5}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}, {"name": "image", "links": [14], "label": "image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}], "size": [270, 150], "pos": [2479.9423828125, 484.5041809082031], "widgets_values": ["", "", "txt", true], "inputs": [{"name": "text", "link": 7, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image", "link": 13, "label": "image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}, {"widget": {"name": "output_file_path"}, "name": "output_file_path", "label": "output_file_path", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "output_file_path"}, {"widget": {"name": "file_name"}, "name": "file_name", "label": "file_name", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "file_name"}, {"widget": {"name": "file_extension"}, "name": "file_extension", "label": "file_extension", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "file_extension"}, {"widget": {"name": "overwrite"}, "name": "overwrite", "label": "overwrite", "type": 